WEBVTT

00:00.030 --> 00:02.400
<i>School Council</i>

00:02.870 --> 00:06.200
Thanks for taking your precious after school time to come here.

00:06.770 --> 00:08.600
Putting those two aside...

00:08.700 --> 00:11.640
Let us introduce ourselves to Kouno.

00:14.240 --> 00:16.740
I'm Arisada, the head of student association.

00:21.380 --> 00:24.680
And this is the vice president Koshino.

00:24.990 --> 00:26.620
They're...

00:26.720 --> 00:28.420
My secretary Tadasu...

00:28.520 --> 00:30.250
...and my accountant Harue.

00:30.630 --> 00:32.220
...all...

00:32.330 --> 00:35.790
We're the key members of the student association.

00:36.530 --> 00:37.930
...pretty.

00:44.310 --> 00:50.840
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

00:50.980 --> 00:57.610
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

00:58.550 --> 01:03.620
<i>I know what I want to</i> <i>say to you every time.</i>

01:03.730 --> 01:10.360
<i>I always have it</i> <i>hidden inside my heart.</i>

01:11.370 --> 01:15.960
<i>I know it's an important feeling...</i>

01:16.310 --> 01:21.680
<i>...and I'm keeping it warm</i> <i>to give it to you someday.</i>

01:23.950 --> 01:29.650
<i>The sound of the bells</i>
<i>I hear from far away...</i>

01:29.750 --> 01:36.590
<i>...makes my heart beat faster and</i> <i>cuts through the sky like a wind.</i>

01:36.690 --> 01:43.430
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

01:43.530 --> 01:49.270
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

01:49.440 --> 01:56.000
<i>And when it's time to tell you</i> <i>the things I've been wanting to say.</i>

01:56.280 --> 02:01.840
<i>You're my sunshine, an eternal smile!</i>

02:02.080 --> 02:12.080
<i>Our prologue, to this exciting story...</i>

02:14.360 --> 02:19.860
<i>A Princess is Born</i>

02:22.900 --> 02:23.560
Hey.

02:23.710 --> 02:26.870
Does this student association choose its members based on their looks?

02:26.940 --> 02:27.930
Are you kidding me?

02:28.040 --> 02:30.810
They wouldn't choose school representatives just because they look good!

02:30.910 --> 02:34.680
We wouldn't be one of the elite schools by doing things like that!

02:34.750 --> 02:37.520
It's just that we have this weird princess thing!

02:37.590 --> 02:39.380
So I thought there would be other things like that as well!

02:39.620 --> 02:42.060
Besides, when you take a look at their faces...

02:42.320 --> 02:43.920
...you can't blame me for saying things like that!

02:47.360 --> 02:49.520
That's an interesting remark, Kouno.

02:49.700 --> 02:52.730
Thank you for saying we look good.

02:53.100 --> 02:55.070
It's true what those two said.

02:55.340 --> 02:57.530
We don't pick our members by their looks.

02:57.610 --> 02:58.700
But...

02:59.540 --> 03:01.740
...I actually was chosen because of my good looks.

03:03.780 --> 03:04.970
What are you saying, Arisada!

03:05.080 --> 03:06.380
That's not true!

03:06.450 --> 03:08.640
Everybody knows what you're capable of!

03:09.050 --> 03:13.580
The others just happened to be good-looking, they can do their jobs.

03:14.020 --> 03:16.990
He might be very cunning...

03:17.630 --> 03:19.860
Now let's get down to business.

03:21.060 --> 03:24.090
I'm sure you know why you're here.

03:24.400 --> 03:25.920
The Princesses?

03:26.030 --> 03:26.900
Right.

03:27.070 --> 03:29.940
How much did they tell you about this princess thing?

03:30.040 --> 03:33.340
Well, since this school is all guys, you need to dress up as princesses...

03:33.440 --> 03:34.880
...in order to provide them with excitement.

03:34.980 --> 03:36.840
You also participate in some school events...

03:36.950 --> 03:39.940
That's right, you become a fake idol in a place full of filthy guys.

03:40.420 --> 03:42.940
Basically, you only play a princess for one year.

03:43.050 --> 03:44.950
You have plenty of time away from your studies, also...

03:45.050 --> 03:48.790
...your body isn't fully developed, so it's easier to wear women's clothes.

03:48.890 --> 03:53.590
And the ones with good looks and personalities will be chosen.

03:53.660 --> 03:56.500
It's not just looks, you have to be liked by others as well.

03:56.770 --> 03:57.630
What?

03:57.830 --> 04:01.430
So if I become a bad character, then I don't have to be a princess?

04:01.540 --> 04:04.100
You shouldn't be a bad character, right?

04:04.540 --> 04:05.970
Mikoto Yutaka.

04:06.610 --> 04:08.440
Your objection is overruled.

04:08.540 --> 04:10.740
You still have to be a princess.

04:12.480 --> 04:15.010
Now here are the duties of a princess.

04:15.420 --> 04:16.850
It looks hard...

04:17.490 --> 04:20.550
I must admit, it's not easy being a princess.

04:20.660 --> 04:21.490
But you see...

04:21.590 --> 04:24.790
...we have prepared some collateral for all the hard work you'll be doing.

04:25.160 --> 04:25.720
What?

04:25.930 --> 04:32.660
That's why our school budget includes this special princess budget.

04:32.870 --> 04:34.460
Right, Harue?

04:34.570 --> 04:35.830
Yes, president.

04:36.510 --> 04:37.910
This is sort of a secret but...

04:38.040 --> 04:40.910
...this princess budget costs the most of all.

04:41.010 --> 04:41.570
What?

04:41.880 --> 04:43.510
Privilege number one.

04:43.810 --> 04:46.110
If the princess job gets in the way of your class...

04:46.250 --> 04:49.450
...leaving school early or being absent will be okay.

04:49.550 --> 04:52.580
Which means they won't mark you late or absent.

04:52.690 --> 04:53.480
I see...

04:53.560 --> 04:56.150
Is that the privilege I get?

04:56.220 --> 04:57.190
Nope!

04:57.260 --> 05:00.420
This is just like a side dish of potato salad.

05:00.530 --> 05:02.500
Wait until you hear the main course!

05:02.960 --> 05:04.800
Privilege number two.

05:06.230 --> 05:10.000
You will receive 30 meal tickets each month.

05:10.070 --> 05:10.870
What?

05:10.970 --> 05:14.200
So if I eat lunch at school everyday, then I can eat for free?

05:14.640 --> 05:16.240
Privilege number three.

05:16.510 --> 05:20.970
The necessities, writing implements, gym clothes, shoes, school uniforms...

05:21.080 --> 05:23.640
...will all be provided to you.

05:23.850 --> 05:25.550
Which means everything will be free!

05:27.560 --> 05:28.220
Free?

05:28.290 --> 05:29.450
Everything is free?

05:29.560 --> 05:30.960
Of course!

05:31.090 --> 05:31.890
Free!

05:31.960 --> 05:33.660
Free is wonderful!

05:33.960 --> 05:35.660
He finds my words alluring.

05:35.760 --> 05:37.160
There's more.

05:37.270 --> 05:38.030
What?

05:38.300 --> 05:41.240
But this has nothing to do with the privileges.

05:42.200 --> 05:46.200
Our photography club sells photos of popular students.

05:46.610 --> 05:48.470
A portion of the profits gained from selling photos...

05:48.580 --> 05:50.910
...are returned to the rightful owners of the photos.

05:51.010 --> 05:52.240
What do you mean by that?

05:52.610 --> 05:56.520
Another words, you get some allowance.

05:57.190 --> 05:58.740
Allowance!

05:59.790 --> 06:02.760
When you become a princess, they'll take lots of pictures.

06:02.890 --> 06:05.490
So I'm sure you'll get a lot of money.

06:05.760 --> 06:07.250
Well? Do you want to be a princess?

06:07.560 --> 06:08.190
Yes!

06:08.560 --> 06:09.590
Hey Kouno!

06:09.730 --> 06:12.760
If it's that good, then of course I'll do it!

06:12.970 --> 06:17.530
Man, I thought it was just a pain without any rewards.

06:17.640 --> 06:18.200
Kouno!

06:18.670 --> 06:21.800
Why didn't you tell me all this in the first place, Shihoudani?

06:21.940 --> 06:25.180
But you seemed pretty shocked after hearing about it...

06:25.280 --> 06:26.810
...and you never bothered to listen.

06:26.920 --> 06:27.940
Kouno!

06:28.320 --> 06:31.580
Why did you easily accept after being allured by all those goodies?

06:31.720 --> 06:36.090
If you just dress up as a girl and act all nice and get all of that...

06:36.160 --> 06:37.590
...then it's really not a bad idea, right?

06:37.690 --> 06:40.180
But don't you have any pride as a guy?

06:40.600 --> 06:41.290
No.

06:42.230 --> 06:45.220
For a student living with a very limited budget...

06:45.830 --> 06:47.130
There's no such thing as pride!

06:47.200 --> 06:48.140
Listen!

06:48.200 --> 06:51.000
They'll make you wear clothes trimmed with a frill...

06:51.140 --> 06:52.970
...or shave unnecessary hair and apply makeup!

06:53.040 --> 06:54.810
You think you can go through all that?

06:54.910 --> 06:58.140
You get chased by men since you keep saying immature things like that.

06:58.280 --> 06:59.300
What?

06:59.680 --> 07:02.780
Is it wrong to be like a man?

07:02.850 --> 07:04.580
If you want to be like a man...

07:04.650 --> 07:07.990
...then what do you say about not accepting your duties?

07:09.060 --> 07:12.120
You need to have the strength to do what they ask of you...

07:12.190 --> 07:13.630
...and if you don't have a way out...

07:13.700 --> 07:17.150
...then you must be tolerant, and just deal with the tasks they give you.

07:17.270 --> 07:19.630
Isn't that what a real man does?

07:21.670 --> 07:24.230
Why do you hate it so much, Mikoto?

07:24.370 --> 07:25.930
He has a girlfriend.

07:26.040 --> 07:26.740
What?

07:26.840 --> 07:29.070
It's an example of complicated male psychology!

07:29.180 --> 07:30.340
I see.

07:30.410 --> 07:32.940
I wouldn't want to play a girl if I had a girlfriend too.

07:33.050 --> 07:34.180
It's not like that!

07:34.380 --> 07:36.040
I'm sorry, Yutaka.

07:36.320 --> 07:38.180
I didn't know about your situation.

07:38.650 --> 07:41.350
Then I'll be happy to explain this situation to your girlfriend.

07:41.420 --> 07:42.320
No thank you!

07:42.690 --> 07:43.950
Arisada!

07:44.060 --> 07:45.320
Are you done talking?

07:45.390 --> 07:47.260
Oh, Natasho.

07:47.630 --> 07:49.120
You came at the right time.

07:49.300 --> 07:52.320
Kouno just agreed to do the job.

07:52.400 --> 07:53.600
Really?

07:53.700 --> 07:54.860
Let me take a look!

07:55.100 --> 07:56.590
What? What is it?

07:58.140 --> 07:59.330
This is it!

07:59.410 --> 08:00.770
For the wigs, Kouno will wear black!

08:00.880 --> 08:02.670
Brown for Shihoudani! Red for Yutaka!

08:02.740 --> 08:03.730
Also add a minihat!

08:03.850 --> 08:05.970
Better yet, they can use a different colored headrest!

08:06.080 --> 08:08.140
Their socks definitely have to be trimmed with lace just like their skirts...

08:08.250 --> 08:09.680
...and have to be oversocks!

08:09.780 --> 08:11.080
Good! You guys are good!

08:11.190 --> 08:13.380
The best incarnations!

08:14.920 --> 08:17.980
Natasho, you're scaring them.

08:19.260 --> 08:20.190
Sorry about that.

08:20.260 --> 08:22.660
I went too far with all this excitement!

08:22.730 --> 08:23.320
Seeya!

08:23.430 --> 08:26.700
I'll go make some sketches from the ideas I just got!

08:27.900 --> 08:29.230
What was that all about?

08:29.300 --> 08:32.240
He's in charge of your wardrobes.

08:32.470 --> 08:35.030
He's Natasho, a member of the home economics club.

08:35.110 --> 08:37.880
He got a bit worked up and showed you his eccentric side...

08:37.950 --> 08:39.920
...but he's really a nice person.

08:40.080 --> 08:41.880
He's really into his hobby.

08:41.950 --> 08:42.650
I see...

08:42.980 --> 08:45.950
If Kouno is willing to do it, then I can quit...

08:46.050 --> 08:46.850
Overruled!

08:46.960 --> 08:47.850
But president...

08:47.960 --> 08:49.690
I said "no" right?

08:49.890 --> 08:52.420
It's only for a year, just hang in there.

08:52.490 --> 08:55.330
You can say that since it doesn't concern you!

08:55.460 --> 08:56.430
You're wrong.

08:56.700 --> 08:57.190
What?

08:57.430 --> 09:00.270
He can say that because it's his concern as well.

09:00.370 --> 09:02.130
He has experience.

09:02.240 --> 09:04.170
Arisada used to be a princess too.

09:04.340 --> 09:05.240
What?

09:05.370 --> 09:06.860
What?

09:07.140 --> 09:10.140
I told you I was chosen for my good looks.

09:10.280 --> 09:13.370
I became president because I did my duties as a princess.

09:14.180 --> 09:18.120
When I was a princess, my wardrobe manager loved kimonos.

09:18.250 --> 09:21.190
I had a hard time with the broad sash being on too tight.

09:21.390 --> 09:25.220
But he looked stylish and cute with that long pleated skirt.

09:25.860 --> 09:29.160
Your traditional princess look and ceremonial attire was good too...

09:29.530 --> 09:32.970
No, no. The long-sleeved kimono was great too.

09:35.000 --> 09:37.230
Stop it you guys!
You're embarrassing me!

09:38.340 --> 09:39.360
I got it!

09:39.470 --> 09:41.470
I knew the president reminded me of someone.

09:41.780 --> 09:43.750
He looks just like you, Shihoudani!

09:43.810 --> 09:45.940
You two treat people in a similar way!

09:46.010 --> 09:47.070
Hey!

09:47.180 --> 09:49.780
I'm not a spiteful person like him!

09:50.020 --> 09:51.280
Anyway...

09:52.020 --> 09:54.320
Even I made it through an entire year.

09:54.420 --> 09:58.090
So I'm definitely not going to let my successors give up so easily.

10:00.060 --> 10:01.320
Understand?

10:04.530 --> 10:05.900
Now...

10:06.030 --> 10:09.900
We need to start planning for the announcement of princess Kouno.

10:10.240 --> 10:12.000
It's going to get really busy, everyone!

10:12.070 --> 10:13.510
Let's do a good job, okay?

10:13.040 --> 10:13.510
<i>Yes!</i>

10:14.040 --> 10:15.170
And all of you too!

10:15.540 --> 10:18.910
I know you don't know much, Tohru Kouno.

10:19.310 --> 10:23.270
Yujirou Shihoudani, keep up the good work as a mediator.

10:23.590 --> 10:27.220
You can't get away from all this, Mikoto Yutaka.

10:27.560 --> 10:31.010
I want you three to use your personality and beauty...

10:31.230 --> 10:35.390
...and shed some light onto this school!

10:37.970 --> 10:38.960
What is it?

10:39.070 --> 10:41.560
Your first name is Yujirou?

10:41.840 --> 10:44.200
Yeah, so?

10:44.310 --> 10:46.000
Yujirou...

10:49.940 --> 10:50.910
Yujirou!

10:51.250 --> 10:54.380
Yu-ji-rou!

10:56.250 --> 10:57.220
Yujirou!

10:57.320 --> 10:59.910
Hey Yujirou, can't you hear me?

11:00.020 --> 11:02.050
You think I can't hear you from this close?

11:02.360 --> 11:05.120
Then say something,
I'm calling your name!

11:05.230 --> 11:08.990
I tried to let you know without words that I hate being called like that!

11:09.260 --> 11:13.530
You seem like a guy with a name like Kaoru, Miyabi, or Haruka.

11:13.600 --> 11:17.090
One of those aesthetic names.

11:17.240 --> 11:18.870
But your name is Yujirou.

11:18.970 --> 11:19.570
Yujirou!

11:20.610 --> 11:23.340
It's a very cool name that takes people by surprise!

11:23.440 --> 11:24.500
T-boy.

11:25.250 --> 11:27.220
What's wrong, T-boy?

11:28.520 --> 11:30.450
Don't call me T-boy!

11:30.650 --> 11:33.420
It's a friendly way of calling your name.

11:33.560 --> 11:34.990
You're happy right?

11:38.590 --> 11:41.190
Yujirou!
<i>T-boy!</i>

11:42.230 --> 11:43.430
Unbelievable.

11:43.670 --> 11:45.900
You shouldn't behave childishly over names.

11:47.240 --> 11:49.500
Look who's talking, Miko-chan!

11:49.940 --> 11:51.370
Who are you calling Miko-chan?

11:51.470 --> 11:53.870
I'm not a girl, you know!

11:53.940 --> 11:56.570
But you're one of us too, Miko-chan.

11:56.640 --> 11:58.140
We're not the same!

11:58.250 --> 12:00.410
But Miko-chan will always be Miko-chan.

12:00.650 --> 12:02.280
I told you not to call me that!

12:02.350 --> 12:03.910
It's going to get really interesting.

12:14.330 --> 12:15.960
So it's been decided!

12:16.060 --> 12:17.590
Kouno was cute!

12:17.670 --> 12:19.290
I can't wait for the announcement!

12:23.000 --> 12:24.340
Speak of the devil...

12:24.470 --> 12:26.440
Good luck princess, Kouno!

12:26.510 --> 12:27.980
We support you!

12:29.310 --> 12:32.250
Thanks, please look forward to it.

12:33.480 --> 12:35.420
Kouno, you...

12:35.580 --> 12:37.610
<i>Home Economics Room</i>

12:37.920 --> 12:39.350
Hello!

12:39.490 --> 12:41.150
We came to try on our wardrobes.

12:41.260 --> 12:42.320
Sorry.

12:42.420 --> 12:44.390
Natasho isn't here yet.

12:44.690 --> 12:46.660
Can you just sit around and wait for him?

12:46.960 --> 12:48.160
Okay.

12:49.700 --> 12:51.000
Hey Kouno...

12:51.130 --> 12:51.690
What?

12:51.970 --> 12:55.160
You seem to be getting better at dealing with those fans.

12:55.240 --> 12:59.230
Once I was chosen to be a princess, they all started calling out to me.

12:59.470 --> 13:01.600
If I don't deal with them nicely, then I'll get played.

13:01.710 --> 13:02.570
Played?

13:03.380 --> 13:05.900
Good luck Kouno!

13:06.180 --> 13:08.210
What? Oh! Thanks...

13:08.320 --> 13:10.050
Oh, he's so cute!

13:10.150 --> 13:12.140
He looks so innocent since he's not used to this!

13:12.220 --> 13:14.490
Cute! I'll pet you over and over!

13:14.690 --> 13:17.520
I know what you mean, they do that to me too.

13:17.630 --> 13:20.320
And just when I was wondering what to do...

13:20.430 --> 13:22.560
...I saw someone that served as a great example.

13:22.660 --> 13:23.390
What?

13:24.500 --> 13:25.260
Me?

13:25.600 --> 13:26.530
Yeah.

13:27.100 --> 13:30.160
At first, I thought you were doing a really weird thing...

13:30.270 --> 13:31.740
...but now that we're both in the same situation...

13:31.970 --> 13:34.000
...it's a great way to defend ourselves from others.

13:34.080 --> 13:36.170
By being amiable like that?

13:36.280 --> 13:38.010
Don't talk that way about amiability!

13:38.110 --> 13:41.570
Amiability is the very first action that guarantees victory!

13:43.580 --> 13:46.750
With a determined smile, you don't allow them to get any closer.

13:47.060 --> 13:50.080
You're now in control, then you do whatever you want with them.

13:50.430 --> 13:54.290
Without getting caught off guard, you treat them gently and leave.

13:54.430 --> 13:57.590
And the people who try to approach you will be stranded.

13:57.800 --> 14:00.330
Those near them will also be restrained.

14:00.540 --> 14:03.160
Are you sure that's going to work?

14:03.440 --> 14:05.960
We have never been harmed, you know.

14:06.740 --> 14:10.540
People who rebel recklessly like you are going to get played.

14:10.650 --> 14:11.510
No...

14:12.750 --> 14:16.240
Then if I become more amiable...

14:16.680 --> 14:18.620
You'll be fine if you do it correctly.

14:18.790 --> 14:19.780
Really?

14:20.090 --> 14:21.320
Give it a try.

14:21.460 --> 14:22.750
We'll help you.

14:23.020 --> 14:23.620
O-Okay!

14:24.360 --> 14:25.420
Mikoto!

14:25.490 --> 14:27.590
You look cute as always!

14:27.660 --> 14:30.530
Let me see that flowery smile of yours!

14:31.030 --> 14:32.590
Ah...

14:34.300 --> 14:37.640
Well, um, thanks...

14:37.740 --> 14:40.270
Not good enough!

14:38.810 --> 14:40.270
<i>No way, no way!</i>

14:40.340 --> 14:41.710
Why are you being shy?

14:41.810 --> 14:44.510
That's like saying you want to be played!

14:44.780 --> 14:46.270
Don't be overwhelmed when they call out to you!

14:46.350 --> 14:48.040
Don't get caught off guard! Be confident!

14:48.150 --> 14:50.020
But how?

14:50.120 --> 14:52.780
Be proud.

14:53.090 --> 14:56.180
When you talk to them, speak graciously.

14:56.390 --> 14:57.550
Like...

14:57.830 --> 14:59.090
A queen!

15:01.130 --> 15:03.460
Mikoto, you're a queen!

15:03.530 --> 15:04.730
You have to be a queen!

15:04.830 --> 15:05.730
That's right!

15:05.830 --> 15:08.630
A kind smile that is filled with both confidence and gracefulness!

15:08.700 --> 15:10.070
That's what you have to master!

15:10.140 --> 15:11.130
What?

15:11.710 --> 15:12.540
Hi!

15:12.640 --> 15:16.040
Sorry to keep you folks waiting, my beautiful princesses!

15:18.180 --> 15:19.650
When they call out to you...

15:20.620 --> 15:22.110
...you have to look determined and...

15:23.250 --> 15:25.050
...smile like a queen!

15:27.220 --> 15:28.750
It's beautiful!

15:28.860 --> 15:31.450
How wonderful! I'm deeply moved by your smiles!

15:32.830 --> 15:34.320
Good job Mikoto.

15:34.430 --> 15:36.660
Are you sure that was good?

15:37.100 --> 15:39.230
Natasho didn't approach us, right?

15:39.330 --> 15:40.860
You're right, but...

15:41.140 --> 15:44.130
Isn't this a bit wrong?

15:46.340 --> 15:47.430
And so...

15:47.640 --> 15:50.130
I put my heart and soul into this work!

15:50.280 --> 15:51.800
Take a look!

15:51.910 --> 15:53.510
Well? It's beautiful isn't it?

15:53.610 --> 15:56.550
I personally wanted to use a velveteen material to make one sick dress...

15:56.650 --> 15:59.340
...but it'd be too hot...

15:58.290 --> 15:59.350
<i>Here we go again...</i>

15:59.450 --> 16:01.690
So I made it more comfortable with a blouse and skirt, but...

16:01.790 --> 16:03.520
...the blouse is made of cotton and is highly absorbent.

16:03.590 --> 16:05.250
Do we always have to wear that?

16:05.390 --> 16:06.360
Yeah...

16:06.530 --> 16:07.460
Natasho!

16:07.660 --> 16:10.500
You're speaking in words that we don't understand!

16:10.800 --> 16:13.360
The princesses have to attend a rehearsal after this.

16:13.470 --> 16:14.870
Hurry up and get this over with!

16:15.140 --> 16:16.370
You're right.

16:16.440 --> 16:18.370
Then let's start trying on the wardrobes!

16:18.470 --> 16:19.410
Okay...

16:19.540 --> 16:21.370
Great...

16:22.210 --> 16:24.540
Let's try it on...

16:25.210 --> 16:27.550
Hey, how do you wear this thing?

16:28.520 --> 16:30.380
Don't change here!

16:30.590 --> 16:33.520
What are you talking about?
We're both guys, aren't we?

16:33.620 --> 16:34.880
I know that!

16:34.960 --> 16:37.590
But we want to keep dreaming!

16:38.260 --> 16:41.320
Not even the backstage personnel want to see your true form!

16:41.430 --> 16:43.300
Hey, let's go over there.

16:43.400 --> 16:44.490
Yeah...

16:47.700 --> 16:49.500
Over there!

16:49.600 --> 16:51.400
Place some tape where the actresses will stand!

16:51.470 --> 16:52.800
President Arisada!

16:53.710 --> 16:55.800
Hey, did you finish trying on your wardrobes?

16:55.910 --> 16:56.570
Yes.

16:56.680 --> 16:57.270
Huh?

16:57.610 --> 16:59.410
What are you doing here, Sakamoto?

16:59.510 --> 17:01.750
Class representatives automatically become members...

17:01.820 --> 17:03.650
...of the student association's executive committee.

17:03.750 --> 17:05.480
I'm just helping out with the setup.

17:05.590 --> 17:07.250
That's not all.

17:07.420 --> 17:10.550
He's a candidate to succeed me as president of the student association.

17:10.660 --> 17:12.890
So I'm teaching him how to be in charge.

17:13.260 --> 17:13.920
What?

17:14.000 --> 17:16.400
I knew it...

17:16.560 --> 17:17.590
That's not true!

17:17.670 --> 17:20.760
He said I should stay here and memorize the organization...

17:21.940 --> 17:23.800
President Arisada?

17:24.640 --> 17:27.700
Well you see, that's just what I have in mind.

17:27.810 --> 17:29.170
That's all.

17:29.280 --> 17:30.770
Think about it, okay?

17:32.510 --> 17:35.280
I didn't know he was planning such a thing...

17:35.780 --> 17:38.410
He's like a dictator with no clear vision...

17:38.850 --> 17:41.410
Anyway, what are you supposed to be, Sakamoto?

17:41.660 --> 17:44.750
Students call you Mr. Sakamoto, even older students talk to you politely.

17:44.830 --> 17:46.790
Candidate for president...

17:46.890 --> 17:48.490
Are you controlling the entire school?

17:48.630 --> 17:50.260
No way!

17:50.460 --> 17:52.430
I'm just an ordinary freshman!

17:53.030 --> 17:55.630
Well you see...

17:55.770 --> 17:58.640
...my older brother graduated when I came this school.

17:58.970 --> 18:02.240
And he was a very beautiful person.

18:02.310 --> 18:04.970
He was very popular among the students.

18:05.250 --> 18:08.910
They were calling him
Mr. Sakamoto all the time.

18:10.280 --> 18:12.620
Mr. Sakamoto! Mr. Sakamoto!

18:12.690 --> 18:13.920
Mr. Sakamoto!

18:14.320 --> 18:15.980
That's why they treat me like that.

18:16.060 --> 18:19.820
I look nothing like my brother, but they still call me Mr. Sakamoto!

18:19.930 --> 18:22.330
And since the older students are treating me nicely...

18:22.430 --> 18:24.260
...the freshmen are starting to copy their behavior as well.

18:25.430 --> 18:26.990
Come to think of it...

18:27.300 --> 18:30.570
I think the president started calling me Mr. Sakamoto as well...

18:32.070 --> 18:35.440
He's committing a crime of conscience...

18:40.780 --> 18:43.550
I'm so tired...

18:43.720 --> 18:45.480
You should feel lucky.

18:45.590 --> 18:48.610
Mikoto and I went through these announcements twice already.

18:49.020 --> 18:50.550
Ah, that's right.

18:50.730 --> 18:52.320
Sorry for making you guys come today.

18:52.430 --> 18:53.790
It's okay.

18:53.890 --> 18:55.800
But are you sure about this?

18:55.900 --> 18:56.420
What?

18:56.530 --> 18:57.760
Becoming a princess.

18:57.870 --> 18:58.560
Ah...

18:59.930 --> 19:02.030
I'm actually happy that I was chosen.

19:02.470 --> 19:05.700
The less money I spend, the better.

19:08.510 --> 19:12.710
Then I can ease the burden on my uncle...

19:22.320 --> 19:26.060
That's all, this will conclude the student association's topic of discussion.

19:26.730 --> 19:29.460
Now, this is what you've all been waiting for!

19:30.360 --> 19:34.800
I'd like to introduce our newest princess and get this party started!

19:34.940 --> 19:36.900
Let's meet our princesses!

19:40.640 --> 19:43.300
First, you've already met her from the previous announcement...

19:43.740 --> 19:46.580
Lady Shihoudani, the Princess of the East!

19:48.050 --> 19:50.580
Lady Yutaka, the Princess of the West!

19:52.450 --> 19:55.580
And now, this is what you've all been waiting for!

19:55.790 --> 19:58.560
A transfer student who came late in the semester...

19:58.660 --> 20:00.590
Lady Tohru Kouno, our newest princess!

20:18.780 --> 20:22.980
And now, the princesses are going to meet and greet you all!

20:23.980 --> 20:26.650
Try not to go over the ropes!

20:26.750 --> 20:29.120
Don't push! Stop pushing!

20:30.520 --> 20:31.990
Smile normally, Mikoto!

20:32.430 --> 20:34.950
Like a queen. Smile like a queen.

20:38.570 --> 20:40.870
Mikoto smiled!

20:39.970 --> 20:40.870
<i>Mikoto actually smiled!</i>

20:41.070 --> 20:45.160
They know we're fake, but
I never imagined so much excitement...

20:45.470 --> 20:47.640
They don't get out much.

20:47.710 --> 20:50.140
I'm sure they'd have a sense of fulfillment at a co-ed school.

20:50.410 --> 20:53.780
Well, we do know a shrewd guy with a girlfriend...

20:53.880 --> 20:55.370
Stop insinuating things!

20:55.520 --> 20:58.080
But I didn't think it would be this fancy...

20:58.190 --> 21:00.590
That's why I asked if you really wanted to do this.

21:00.890 --> 21:04.150
Anyway, we're all in this together now.

21:05.190 --> 21:08.460
Nice to be working with you for the next year.

21:09.430 --> 21:10.490
Same here.

21:10.630 --> 21:14.160
I'll probably give you trouble since I'm not used to this, but...

21:14.440 --> 21:17.060
I'm sure Mikoto will be giving us the most trouble.

21:17.170 --> 21:18.140
What?

21:25.580 --> 21:26.710
Mr. Sakamoto.

21:26.810 --> 21:28.870
Try to memorize the entire program.

21:28.980 --> 21:29.950
President!

21:41.760 --> 21:49.230
<i>If you're sad and feeling</i> <i>down, then call out to me.</i>

21:49.500 --> 21:57.540
<i>I'll be in the area, so let</i> <i>me know what's bothering you.</i>

21:57.980 --> 22:05.440
<i>If you're all by yourself,</i> <i>then you'll forget how to smile.</i>

22:05.550 --> 22:13.120
<i>A smile is something you</i> <i>share with another person.</i>

22:13.230 --> 22:23.230
<i>Hey, the future you can see</i> <i>from the classroom window...</i>

22:23.570 --> 22:30.100
<i>...is getting larger after</i> <i>taking in the sunlight.</i>

22:30.580 --> 22:31.980
<i>Smile at me!</i>

22:32.110 --> 22:39.880
<i>A smile is what makes you feel energetic!</i>

22:39.950 --> 22:46.050
<i>I want to give some smiles to you...</i>

22:46.130 --> 22:48.100
<i>...right away.</i>

22:48.330 --> 22:58.330
<i>In order for you to lift</i> <i>your head up and start walking.</i>

23:05.010 --> 23:09.950
Next Episode, The First
Job, Princess Cheerleaders
